---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import LinkHub from '../../components/LinkHub.astro';
import FixtureAntiStale from '../../components/FixtureAntiStale.astro';
import OriginalFourBars from '../../components/OriginalFourBars.astro';
import { withBase, absUrl } from '../../site';
import { FOUR_BARS_DIR, FOUR_BARS_MAPS, SHOW_UNTIL_FAN_WEEKEND } from '../../data/fourBars';

const PATH = '/from-sol-hotel-first-sunday-street-victoria-6/';
const PATH_ES = '/es/del-hotel-sol-primera-calle-domingo-victoria-6/';
const SHOW_UNTIL = SHOW_UNTIL_FAN_WEEKEND;
const MAPS = FOUR_BARS_MAPS;
const DIR = FOUR_BARS_DIR;
const articleLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'Hotel or Airbnb near Sol: first Sunday street is Victoria 6, then three sister doors',
  inLanguage: 'en',
  datePublished: '2026-11-08T01:00:00+01:00',
  dateModified: '2026-11-08T01:00:00+01:00',
  image: absUrl('/images/facade.jpg'),
  mainEntityOfPage: absUrl(PATH),
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Dubliners Irish Pub', url: absUrl('/') },
  publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Dubliners Irish Pub', url: absUrl('/') },
};
const faqLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'I am in a hotel or Airbnb near Sol. Where do I walk first on Sunday morning?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Time the first walk so you reach Four Corner, Calle de la Victoria 6, before 14:00. The door is not open before 14:00. Once it opens (sports screens), hop the three sister doors already in the same pocket: O’Reilly’s at Pasaje de Matheu 4, then Dubliners and O’Connell’s at Calle de Espoz y Mina 7.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'How far is Victoria 6 from a Sol hotel, and then to the other three doors?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'From the east side of Puerta del Sol, Calle de la Victoria 6 is about 2–3 minutes / 180–220 m. Typical rooms on Carretas, Mayor, Preciados, Arenal or Montera are 3–8 minutes / 250–600 m. Victoria 6 to Pasaje de Matheu 4 is about 2 minutes / 120–150 m. Victoria 6 to Espoz y Mina 7 is about 2 minutes / 150–180 m. Matheu 4 to Espoz y Mina 7 is about 1 minute / 90 m. Dubliners and O’Connell’s share the same street number — different doors, a few seconds apart.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Is Four Corner open before 14:00, and is Saturday’s meetup or Valencia–RM still on?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'No. Four Corner opens Sunday 8 November from 14:00 until late, with sports screens. The Saturday 18:00–19:00 meetup and Valencia vs Real Madrid 21:00 (Dubliners only) are finished. Do not walk as if they are still tonight.',
      },
    },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sol hotel to Victoria 6 before 14:00, then three doors | Dubliners"
  description="Sunday 8 Nov: leave the Sol hotel/Airbnb so you hit Four Corner, Victoria 6, before 14:00. Then Matheu 4 and Espoz y Mina 7 twice. Maps, metres. FIND US."
  path={PATH}
  lang="en"
  hreflang={{ en: PATH, es: PATH_ES }}
  ogImage="/images/facade.jpg"
  extraJsonLd={[articleLd, faqLd]}
>
  <section class="hero hero-compact" data-show-until={SHOW_UNTIL}>
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumb current="Sol hotel: first Sunday street to Victoria 6" schema />
      <h1>Hotel or Airbnb near Sol: first Sunday street is Victoria 6, then three sister doors</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Saturday is over. You woke up in a room a few minutes from Puerta del Sol.
        <strong>The first useful Sunday walk is Calle de la Victoria 6 — arrive before 14:00, do not expect the door before 14:00.</strong>
        Four Corner opens then, with sports screens. After that pin, hop the three sister doors already in the same streets:
        Pasaje de Matheu 4, then Espoz y Mina 7 twice. Metres, not a taxi. Maps CIDs below.
      </p>
      <p class="small">En español: <a href={withBase(PATH_ES)} hreflang="es" lang="es">Del hotel en Sol a Victoria 6, luego tres puertas hermanas</a></p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" data-track-event="directions_click" href={DIR.fourCorner} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Walk Victoria 6</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" data-track-event="directions_click" href={MAPS.fourCorner} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Four Corner on Maps</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={withBase('/4-bars-one-fan-weekend/')}>MEET US NEAR SOL</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>This is a hotel checkout walk, not last night’s streets</h2>
      <p>
        Other pages already cover the overnight clock from Saturday, the generic Sol-to-four-bars walk,
        Sunday lunch then screens, and Four Corner’s 14:00 opening itself.
        This page is only the guest still in a Sol hotel or Airbnb on Sunday morning:
        <strong>which street to walk first, how many metres, when the first door actually opens.</strong>
        The 18:00–19:00 meetup and Valencia vs Real Madrid 21:00 are finished. Do not re-walk them as if they are still on.
      </p>

      <h2>Leave the room so you hit Victoria 6 before 14:00</h2>
      <p>
        From the east side of Puerta del Sol, look toward Carrera de San Jerónimo / Calle de la Victoria — not Gran Vía, not a metro hop.
        <strong>Calle de la Victoria 6 is about 2–3 minutes / 180–220 m from the square.</strong>
        If your room is on Carretas, Mayor, Preciados, Arenal or Montera, budget <strong>3–8 minutes / 250–600 m</strong>.
        Time the walk for <strong>13:40–13:55</strong>. Stand on the street; the bar is shut until 14:00.
        When it opens, it has sports screens — we do not list which game is on. Ask at the door.
        {' '}<a href={MAPS.fourCorner} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Maps</a>
        {' · '}<a href={DIR.fourCorner} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Walking directions</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you leave the room well before 13:30, do not camp a closed door for an hour.
        Pin Victoria 6, use Matheu or Espoz y Mina (already open), and be back on Victoria for 14:00.
        The first <em>Sunday street</em> you should still treat as the target is Victoria 6.
      </p>

      <h2>After 14:00 — three nearby sister doors, street by street</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Four Corner — Calle de la Victoria 6</strong> (first pin, from 14:00).
          Sports screens. Sunday until late. Not open before 14:00.
          {' '}<a href={MAPS.fourCorner} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Maps</a>
          {' · '}<a href={DIR.fourCorner} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Walking directions</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>O’Reilly’s Restaurant Bar — Pasaje de Matheu 4.</strong>
          About <strong>2 minutes / 120–150 m</strong> west/south-west of Victoria 6.
          Terrace restaurant-bar, usual from 11:30. First sister door after the Victoria pin.
          {' '}<a href={MAPS.oreillys} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Maps</a>
          {' · '}<a href={DIR.oreillys} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Walking directions</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Dubliners — Calle de Espoz y Mina 7.</strong>
          About <strong>2 minutes / 150–180 m</strong> from Victoria 6, or <strong>1 minute / 90 m</strong> from Matheu 4.
          Sunday from 12:00. Named screens sit on <a href={withBase('/whats-on/')}>What’s On</a> — ask which game is on.
          {' '}<a href={MAPS.dubliners} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Maps</a>
          {' · '}<a href={DIR.dubliners} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Walking directions</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>O’Connell’s — Calle de Espoz y Mina 7</strong> (Maps listing: O’Connell St).
          Same street number as Dubliners, different door — a few seconds, not a new walk.
          Sunday 8 Nov from 12:00 (usual Sunday 14:00). Meeting point; we do not invent its board.
          {' '}<a href={MAPS.oconnell} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Maps</a>
          {' · '}<a href={DIR.oconnell} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Walking directions</a>.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        All four pins sit in the same pocket south-east of Sol. Premier League from 15:00, NFL afternoon/evening,
        and Atlético–Barcelona 21:00 share the same streets — they sit alongside this walk; this page does not replace those clocks.
        Named listings stay on Dubliners’ What’s On. Not every game on every screen.
      </p>

      <OriginalFourBars lang="en" when="sunday" />

      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <dl class="faq">
        <dt><strong>Hotel near Sol. First Sunday walk?</strong></dt>
        <dd>Victoria 6 before 14:00. Four Corner is shut until then. After it opens, hop Matheu 4 then Espoz y Mina 7 twice.</dd>
        <dt><strong>How far, street by street?</strong></dt>
        <dd>Sol east side → Victoria 6 ~2–3 min / 180–220 m. Typical Sol rooms 3–8 min. Victoria 6 → Matheu 4 ~2 min / 120–150 m. Victoria 6 → Espoz y Mina 7 ~2 min / 150–180 m. Matheu ↔ Espoz ~1 min / 90 m.</dd>
        <dt><strong>Is Four Corner open before 14:00? Is Saturday still on?</strong></dt>
        <dd>No, and no. Door from 14:00 with sports screens. Meetup 18:00–19:00 and Valencia–RM 21:00 are finished.</dd>
      </dl>

      <LinkHub
        heading="h2"
        groups={[
          {
            title: 'Sunday streets from the room',
            until: SHOW_UNTIL,
            items: [
              { href: '/', label: 'FIND US — Dubliners home' },
              { href: '/visit/', label: 'GET DIRECTIONS — visit / hours' },
              { href: '/4-bars-one-fan-weekend/', label: 'MEET US NEAR SOL' },
              { href: '/wake-sol-sunday-premier-block-which-door/', label: 'Woke up: 15:00 Premier — which Sunday door' },
              { href: '/four-corner-opens-sunday-1400/', label: 'Four Corner Sunday 14:00' },
              { href: PATH_ES, label: 'Del hotel en Sol a Victoria 6', note: 'En español', hreflang: 'es', lang: 'es' },
            ],
          },
        ]}
      />
    </div>
  </section>
  <FixtureAntiStale />
</BaseLayout>
